+# Billing disputes
+
+`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` classifies a message containing the lowercase text `refund` as `refund-review`; every other message is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+For refund and invoice questions, use that classification as the supported billing disposition. Do not infer a refund decision, invoice change, processing status, or timing that the implementation or other available project evidence does not establish.

